| `scripts/pytest_markers.py` | The one reader of `pytest.mark.<name>(...)` calls from a test file's syntax tree, and of the names pytest collects, shared by requirement traceability and the end-to-end coverage gate. | imported | [`traceability.marker`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | Reads source: a marker reached through a name other than `pytest.mark` or an imported `mark` is invisible. Needs the project interpreter; not 3.6-safe. | [README.md](../specs/README.md) | always |
